@Pawmart_HostAddress = http://localhost:5164
@accessToken = paste-jwt-here

### Health
GET {{Pawmart_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Public product search
GET {{Pawmart_HostAddress}}/api/products?page=1&pageSize=20&sort=newest
Accept: application/json

### Categories
GET {{Pawmart_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### Register a customer (replace the example values before sending)
POST {{Pawmart_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "fullName": "Pawmart Customer",
  "password": "Replace-With-A-Long-Unique-Password",
  "phoneNumber": "0900000000"
}

### Log in
POST {{Pawmart_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "password": "Replace-With-A-Long-Unique-Password"
}

### AI recommendation (requires configured AI provider and the customer's pet ID)
POST {{Pawmart_HostAddress}}/api/chat/recommendations
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "petId": 1
}
